8. bxc3 { [%eval 0.14] White takes, and now has doubled pawns on the c-file. }
8... Qe7 $10
{ [%eval 0.28] Unpins the knight in a useful way and prepares ...Nd8 and ...Ng6. The doubled c-pawns give Black an easy game. }
